OL,3,GNEWSABomb threats reported against
OL,4,Amultiple flights across Europe for
OL,5,Asecond time this week
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier an aircraft was escorted into
OL,8,FRome Fiumicino Airport by Italian Air
OL,9,FForce jets, while a flight from Warsaw
OL,10,Fto Brussels landed safely following a
OL,11,F"potential security threat" - in both
OL,12,Fcases officials say no suspicious items
OL,13,Fwere found
OL,15,FAir traffic control messages analysed
OL,16,Fby BBC Verify show one diverted
OL,17,Faircraft - travelling from Dublin to
OL,18,FRome - was alerted to a potential
OL,19,Fthreat by air traffic control
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
